flowchart
  accTitle: Compatibility evidence has a writer-reader direction
  accDescr: Old-to-new, new-to-old and intermediary rewrite paths are separate tests; each needs wire decoding, field preservation and semantic interpretation evidence.
subgraph A["Old data into new reader"]
    A1["Old writer"] --> A2["New reader: decode + meaning"]
